      {"type":"Use","label":"Mass Shift","cost":{"action":"move"},"limit":{"per":"scene"},"steps":[{"do":"choose","prompt":"Benefit","options":[{"label":"+1 to a Defense","steps":[{"do":"pick","key":"defense","from":"list","options":[["toughness","E20.DefenseToughness"],["evasion","E20.DefenseEvasion"],["willpower","E20.DefenseWillpower"],["cleverness","E20.DefenseCleverness"]],"prompt":"Defense (if chosen)"},{"do":"fireEvent","event":"massShiftUsed"},{"do":"mark","key":"massShiftToughness","to":"self","until":"scene","when":["var:picked=toughness"]},{"do":"mark","key":"massShiftEvasion","to":"self","until":"scene","when":["var:picked=evasion"]},{"do":"mark","key":"massShiftWillpower","to":"self","until":"scene","when":["var:picked=willpower"]},{"do":"mark","key":"massShiftCleverness","to":"self","until":"scene","when":["var:picked=cleverness"]}]},{"label":"↑1 on a Skill","steps":[{"do":"pick","key":"skill","from":"skill","prompt":"Skill (if chosen)"},{"do":"fireEvent","event":"massShiftUsed"},{"do":"mark","key":"massShiftSkill","to":"self","until":"scene"}]},{"label":"Double your Reach","steps":[{"do":"fireEvent","event":"massShiftUsed"},{"do":"mark","key":"massShiftReach","to":"self","until":"scene"}]},{"label":"1 Temporary Health","steps":[{"do":"fireEvent","event":"massShiftUsed"},{"do":"tempResource","kind":"health","amount":1,"to":"self"}]}]}]},
      {"type":"ItemModifier","label":"Mass Shift (Melee Reach x2)","items":["item:type:weaponEffect","item:data:system.classification.style=melee"],"path":"system.totalReach","op":"max","value":"@reach.size * 2","when":["self:marked:massShiftReach"]},
      {"type":"Defense","label":"Mass Shift (+1 Toughness)","defense":"toughness","amount":1,"when":["self:marked:massShiftToughness"]},
      {"type":"Defense","label":"Mass Shift (+1 Evasion)","defense":"evasion","amount":1,"when":["self:marked:massShiftEvasion"]},
